Morph Timeline Extension for SvgPathEditor
==========================================

This distribution is a modified version of SvgPathEditor.

Upstream project : https://github.com/Yqnn/svg-path-editor
Upstream author  : Yann Armelin (https://github.com/Yqnn)
Upstream license : Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)
Upstream commit  : 937d75a83b6be2bdda11d02b9b3594841315223a ("Bump lib version")
Upstream tag     : 1.0.4

Modifications
-------------
Added by this fork. No upstream file was rewritten wholesale; changes are
either new files or small, clearly marked insertions.

New files
  src/lib/path-morph.ts                 geometry engine: command parsing to
                                        cubic Bézier sub-paths, arc-to-cubic
                                        conversion, sub-path / segment
                                        equalisation, start-point alignment,
                                        interpolation, easing, timeline
                                        resolution
  src/lib/path-morph.spec.ts            48 unit tests for the above
  src/lib/morph-export.ts               SVG (SMIL) and standalone HTML exporters
  src/lib/morph-export.spec.ts          23 unit tests for the exporters
  src/app/morph-timeline/               timeline UI component (TS/HTML/SCSS)

Modified files
  src/app/app.module.ts                 declared MorphTimelineComponent
  src/app/app.component.ts              morph preview state and handlers
  src/app/app.component.html            editor column wrapper, timeline dock,
                                        morph preview binding on <svg>
  src/app/app.component.scss            .editor-column / .morph-dock layout,
                                        phone breakpoint handling
  src/app/canvas/canvas.component.ts    added the `morphPreviewPath` input
  src/app/canvas/canvas.component.html  added the preview overlay <path>
  src/app/canvas/canvas.component.css   added .dimmed / .morph-preview styles

Nothing in the upstream editing model, command grammar, undo history, or path
operations was altered. Existing behaviour is covered by the original 55 unit
tests, which still pass unmodified.

